# The embedded metrics-server manifest ships byte-for-byte as upstream published it, and a test
# checks its SHA-256 against the published checksum. Git's EOL conversion would rewrite those bytes
# on a Windows checkout — quietly, and only there — so the file that gets embedded into a Windows
# build would no longer be the release it claims to be. -text says these bytes are an artifact, not
# text to be normalized.
src/Kontena.Adapters.Kubernetes/Resources/*.yaml -text
